<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-BNP raised at Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-BNP raised at Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Nationale de Paris was raised to &quot;outperform&quot; from &quot;neutral&quot; at Lehman Brothers, a note from analyst Sheila Garrard at the brokerage said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Garrard raised her forecast for the French banking group's net income to 4.745 billion francs from 3.740 billion and also said the stock had been added to Lehman's &quot;recommended&quot; list.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
